            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Sentinel (missing / not-applicable) value domain(s) for this variable (RepresentedVariable.takesSentinelValuesFrom).
:inlineOrByReference: ``inline``
:orReference: ["value", "idReference"]
:schemaRef: "cdifDataType/cdifValueDomain#/$defs/SentinelValueDomain"</body>
